   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    180,
    60
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "color": 4,
    "content": "## 🎯 AgentKit · 03 — Lead Qualifier\n**Website form → AI lead scoring (1-10) → hot leads foran Telegram pe.**\n\n**Setup (10 min):**\n1. **Webhook URL** — 🌐 Webhook node kholo → Production URL copy karo → apne landing page form mein lagao. Fields: `name, email, business, budget, message`.\n2. **AI** — CONFIG: Ollama ya OpenAI.\n3. **Telegram** — 🔥 Hot Lead Alert node pe credential. Chat ID CONFIG mein.\n4. **Sheets** — tab `leads`: `date | name | email | business | budget | score | verdict | reason`.\n5. **Active** karo → test POST bhejo.\n\n**Flow:** Webhook → AI judge (score+verdict JSON) → score >= threshold? → Hot: Telegram alert + log | Cold: sirf log.\n**Pro tip:** `score_threshold` 7 hai. Strict chahiye? 8 karo.\n",
    "height": 700,
    "width": 620
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "e0de20b8-74fb-404a-9624-6a3c3846c5c2",
